          "lang_word": "portable",
          "definition": "a. 可攜帶的、輕便的、可移動的  n. 攜帶式裝置"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "The portable projector fits easily into a carry-on suitcase for business trips.",
          "highlight": [
