          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "平板電腦比筆電更加輕便，這就是為什麼業務員在外出差時偏好使用它們。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Among all the demo devices, this handheld scanner is the most portable and convenient for on-site use.",
          "highlight": [
            "most portable"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "在所有展示裝置中，這台手持掃描器最為輕便，現場使用也最方便。"
