          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Of all the delivery vendors we tested, RedEx was the most punctual, hitting every guaranteed window.",
          "highlight": [
            "most punctual"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "在我們測試過的所有配送廠商中，RedEx 最為準時，每個保證時段都準時送達。"
          }
        }
